WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Exact planning. Read-only by design.
Choose assets, percentages, and a USDC budget. Lotline reads balances and requests estimates without assembling, signing, or submitting transactions.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A small, explicit trust boundary.
Next.js route handlers validate inputs and verify issuer metadata, Solana accounts, and Jupiter responses before returning normalized results.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Money enters as strings.
USDC becomes BigInt micro-units. Percentages become integer basis points totaling 10,000, without binary floating-point money calculations.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Largest remainder keeps the total exact.
10.000001 USDC at 50, 30, and 20 percent becomes 5.000001, 3.000000, and 2.000000. Equal remainders use stable basket order.

5
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Verify identity before counting units.
Resolve the official issuer mint, validate its token program and scaling extension, sum every matching token account, and read the chain clock.

6
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Raw units are not displayed holdings.
The official Token-2022 helper converts raw holdings plus raw quote output using the mint configuration and active scaled multiplier.

7
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Jupiter receives three quote inputs.
Only input mint, output mint, and allocated raw amount are sent. No taker or execute call. Quotes expire after at most 30 seconds.

8
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Old responses cannot become a new plan.
Edits invalidate estimates. Obsolete responses cannot overwrite a current plan. Provider failures and unavailable data remain explicit.

9
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Optional accounts save explicit plans.
Verified sessions and row-level ownership protect up to 20 saved plans. Wallet addresses, balances, and quotes are excluded. Public email delivery still requires custom SMTP.

10
00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Installed web app; fresh data stays online.
The public offline Example can calculate and export. Live and private APIs stay online. Supabase coordinates bounded provider requests across Vercel instances.

11
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Evidence separates fixtures from live results.
Tests cover failure and isolation paths. A dated deployed Live smoke observed six verified assets, confirmed zero balances, and a real quote. It is not current pricing.

12
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Take the plan. Keep the choice.
Copy the plan, export CSV, or review independently on Jupiter. Explore the app at lotlinesolana.vercel.app and source at github.com/operatoruplift/lotline.
